# Explicit dependency for torch/ctranslate2. Security advisory
# GHSA-xmj3-9gf7-h52w requires setuptools >=84.1.0. Legacy webrtcvad
# uses pkg_resources solely to report its version; our MIT-licensed,
# source-reviewed in-tree webrtcvad.py preserves its public VAD API while
# reading the installed *webrtcvad* distribution version through
# importlib.metadata. This avoids two overlapping VAD distributions and
# retains Resemblyzer's declared dependency without relaxing voice auth.
# See issue #726 and tests/test_webrtcvad_compat.py.
